---
title: Other Server Managers
---

## Currently Supported

FOSSBilling currently supports these server managers:

- [CWP](/server-managers/cwp/)
- Plesk
- DirectAdmin
- [HestiaCP](/server-managers/hestiacp/)
- [WHM/cPanel](/server-managers/whm/)

## Our Stance on New Server Managers

We're currently focused on improving FOSSBilling's stability and core features before adding support for additional server managers. We know the community wants more options, and we appreciate your patience.

Want to help? Check out our guide on [creating a server manager](/developing-fossbilling/guides/creating-a-server-manager/).

## Proxmox VE

There's active development on a Proxmox module for FOSSBilling, but it's not ready for production use yet. If you're interested in contributing or following progress, visit the [GitHub repository](https://github.com/FOSSBilling/Proxmox).

## Frequently Requested

See [this GitHub issue](https://github.com/FOSSBilling/FOSSBilling/issues/1362) for a list of server managers the community has requested.

## Not Planned: Pterodactyl

FOSSBilling doesn't support Pterodactyl, and we have no plans to develop or support an integration now or in the future. We know this is a popular request, but we need to focus our limited resources on core functionality.
